  "title": {
   "en": "After Reincarnating, My Enemy Spent a Fortune to Make Me Invincible"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "zh": "投胎后我被仇人氪成无敌"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "In the apocalyptic era, my sisters and I struggled to survive, yet we were nothing more than ants in the eyes of the powerful. On the brink of death, I awakened a reincarnation ability — and was reborn into the family of my enemies. They poured all their resources into raising me, completely unaware that I would one day destroy them from within!"
  },
